{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And they shall make an ark.</b> In all of them it is written ועשית, but here it is written ועשו, because everyone is obligated to engage in it, on account of the honor of the Torah that is within it — and a fortiori for Torah scholars, that the people of their city are commanded to do their work in order to honor them. And thus it is stated in Yoma, chapter בא לו: ״ועשו ארון״ — from here [we learn] regarding Torah scholars, etc." "<b>From inside and from outside you shall overlay it.</b> Rava said: any Torah scholar whose inside is not like his outside is not a Torah scholar. And furthermore, the Holy One, blessed be He, commanded all Israel to engage in it, so that they would all receive the reward for the Torah placed within it."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:03.153135088Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}